## Operationally

- Back up the event database. It is the record that an event was seen.
- Monitor `status = 'failed'` and `status = 'pending'` age. An event pending for
  longer than the provider's retry window usually means processing is stuck.
{{#if webhook.unsigned}}
- **Webhooks are unsigned for this provider.** Reconciliation is therefore not
  optional — an unauthenticated event can only be trusted after a server-side
  status confirmation. Do not fulfil orders from the webhook payload alone.
{{/if}}
